===Etymology===
{{psm|en|yue|-}} {{zh-l|雜碎|zaap6 seoi3|mixed and broken}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|head=[[chop]] suey}}

# {{lb|en|US}} A [[stir-fried]] vegetable dish, served with pieces of beef or pork in a semi-thick sauce, and often soy sauce.
# {{lb|en|Canada|and|British}} Steamed [[bean sprout]]s served in a semi-thick sauce, and mixed with a choice of meat and/or vegetables.

